      }
    ],
    "count": null,
    "comment": "Seeds of two neurons in the same session that share more than 70 % of the smaller seed's pixels (support ≥ 20 % of each seed's peak). Seeds are the included footprints and, for neurons without a footprint in a session, their union footprint at the interpolated position (inferred, shown in cyan with 'Show inferred footprints'). Overlapping seeds compete for the same pixels in seeded redetection: merge the neurons, reassign or exclude one. Set 'Seed pairs' to 'inferred' to skip pairs of detected footprints (see 'Cleanup: within-session duplicates').",
    "apply_to": "same",
